sequenceDiagram
    actor Manager
    participant App as Warehouse Service
    participant DB as Database (Warehouse/Slot)

    Manager->>App: Tạo thông tin Warehouse (City, District)
    App->>DB: Lưu Warehouse
    Manager->>App: Định nghĩa StorageAreas (Cold, Dry, etc.)
    App->>DB: Lưu StorageAreas
    Manager->>App: Khởi tạo Slot tự động (theo Row, Floor)
    Note right of App: Dựa trên maxWidth, maxWeight...
    App->>DB: Bulk Insert Slots
    DB-->>Manager: Kho đã sẵn sàng (Status: OPEN)